        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Elevating Nonprofits with Resources</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47025.webp" alt="Elevating Nonprofits with Resources" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>With your support over the last year, the Community Foundation of Teton Valley continues to provide leadership to nonprofit organizations through outreach, networking opportunities, workshops, and resources.</p>

<p>From one-on-one time to monthly meetings for Executive Directors, Foundation staff is always available to help guide best practices, collaborate, and navigate the ever-changing landscape of local needs to ensure maximum impact for all nonprofits in Teton Valley. The Foundation supports dedicated nonprofit staff and passionate board members working tirelessly to forward critical missions across our community. Whether lending an ear or sharing resources, the Community Foundation provides a solid foundation for nonprofits to build upon.</p>

<p><strong>Nonprofit Leadership</strong><br><strong>2&nbsp;</strong>Pocket Talks<br><strong>3&nbsp;</strong>Board Briefs<br><strong>8&nbsp;</strong>Workshops<br><strong>12&nbsp;</strong>E.D. Exchanges<br><strong>48</strong>&nbsp;Organizations<br><strong>287</strong>&nbsp;Staff &amp; Board</p>

<p><em>“Having the opportunity to work with our peers learning new skills necessary to further our organization’s growth is a vital asset in this community.”</em></p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p>In addition to leadership opportunities, the Community Foundation of Teton Valley aims to strengthen nonprofits by sharing physical resources. Our Nonprofit Conference Room has seen over 100 reservations and 1,200 individuals this year alone! It’s tech-ready for accessible hybrid meetings and a wonderful space for boards to gather for monthly meetings. It is especially beneficial for organizations with small or home offices.</p>

<p>Sharing our&nbsp;<a href="https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcftetonvalley.org%2Fshop%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ccvitucci%40cftetonvalley.org%7Ced3a6b425fd54d86c43408dbfb5b14c5%7Cb04f1710b73341a3ab06600205b83e57%7C0%7C0%7C638380140833482822%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=7MOx6BrRY%2BTHVNKQG5yqYXqGVcimf1v8Oh%2FSApClTGo%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">event equipment</a>,&nbsp;such as tents, tables, chairs, and coolers, helps nonprofits save money. Providing a convenient, local pick-up/drop-off also helps save transport time.</p>

<p><strong>Conference Room</strong><br><strong>139&nbsp;</strong>Reservations<br><strong>1,202&nbsp;</strong>Individuals &nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>Equipment Rental</strong><br><strong>44</strong>&nbsp;Reservations</p>

<p><strong>Nonprofit Savings</strong><br><strong>Total: $52,502</strong></p>

<p>We are proud to be part of a community that values collaboration, generosity, and positive impact. Thank you to all who have supported our efforts and helped make these resources and more possible.</p>

